"main" dogs who played Lassie were male, there were female "stunt 
doubles" who played Lassie.
There were two general reasons why males tended to play Lassie. Males 
have thicker coats, so they end up looking better durring the summer 
when they shed. Males are also bigger, so they look more impressive 
onscreen.
